# Hallmark for frontend

When **designing new UI** or **updating frontend visuals** (layout, look, landing, redesign), load and follow `hallmark` before emitting UI. Pair with `frontend-design`. Use MCP `inspo` for real-site references when choosing a vibe.

Skip only for pure logic/data changes with no visual surface change.
